        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "**The north-west rosette.** One medallion of the nine, traced round its rim rather than boxed: the causeways that leave it at four and eight o'clock belong to the joins, not to this circle, and a rectangle drawn here would claim them. The manuscript's own geometry is round, so the annotation is too.",
